@baseUrl = https://clone-tabnews-gamma-liart.vercel.app/api/v1
@username = usuarioteste

### Criar usuário
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "{{username}}@email.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Criar usuário com email duplicado (espera 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "outrousuario",
  "email": "{{username}}@email.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Criar usuário com username duplicado (espera 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "outroemail@email.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Buscar usuário por username
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{username}}

### Buscar usuário com case diferente
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/UsuarioTeste

### Buscar usuário inexistente (espera 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/usuarioquenaoexiste
